{"title": "Fly Trap", "pageid": 27964, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Fly_Trap", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Fly Trap</b> is a passive feature that can prevent a target from moving.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Chance to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ensnared_(Ensnaring_Strike)_(Condition)\" title=\"Ensnared (Ensnaring Strike) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ensnare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ensnared_(Ensnaring_Strike)_(Condition)\" title=\"Ensnared (Ensnaring Strike) (Condition)\">Ensnare</a> target if it is not a plant or a beast. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Ensnared_.28Ensnaring_Strike.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Ensnared_(Ensnaring_Strike)\"> Condition: Ensnared (Ensnaring Strike) </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ensnared_(Ensnaring_Strike)_(Condition)\" title=\"Ensnared (Ensnaring Strike) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ensnared\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ensnared_(Ensnaring_Strike)_(Condition)\" title=\"Ensnared (Ensnaring Strike) (Condition)\">Ensnared</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"STR Save (DC&nbsp;12)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">STR</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;12)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Cannot move and takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a> damage per turn.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> against the creature have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a>, while the creature's Attack Rolls and <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a>.</li>\n<li>Remove when <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/25px-Help_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/38px-Help_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/50px-Help_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Helped\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/25px-Help_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Help_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\">Helped</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nature%27s_Snare\" title=\"Nature's Snare\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Natures_Snare_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Natures_Snare_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Natures_Snare_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Natures_Snare_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Natures_Snare_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Natures_Snare_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Natures_Snare_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Natures_Snare_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d2/Natures_Snare_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Nature%27s_Snare\" title=\"Nature's Snare\">Nature's Snare</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>In addition to the combat round, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ensnared_(Ensnaring_Strike)_(Condition)\" title=\"Ensnared (Ensnaring Strike) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ensnare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ensnared_(Ensnaring_Strike)_(Condition)\" title=\"Ensnared (Ensnaring Strike) (Condition)\">Ensnare</a> also loses a turn of duration at the beginning of the target's turn. Therefore, Fly Trap can prevent an opponent from moving for <i>one</i> turn at most.</li>\n<li>Piercing damage from Ensnare is applied each turn regardless of whether the save fails or succeeds.</li>\n<li>There are three different kinds saves:\n<ul><li>The first is when the condition is applied. The DC for this is 12.</li>\n<li>The second is at the beginning of the victim's first turn after receiving the condition. The DC for this is Spell save DC. The condition ends if save succeeds.</li>\n<li>The third is at the beginning of the possible second turn, but this one is redundant, because the condition always ends at the start of the second round (see bugs below) regardless of whether the save fails or succeeds. The DC for this is Spell save DC.</li></ul></li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Sharpened_Snare\" title=\"Sharpened Snare\">Sharpened Snare</a> passive feature from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sharpened_Snare_Cuirass\" title=\"Sharpened Snare Cuirass\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sharpened_Snare_Cuirass\" title=\"Sharpened Snare Cuirass\">Sharpened Snare Cuirass</a> affects the second and third save but not the first one.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202742\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.066 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.074 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2340/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30902/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10088/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.018/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 965802/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   62.765      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   62.765      1 -total\n 22.84%   14.337      1 Template:Condition\n 21.20%   13.308      4 Template:Icon_text\n 21.10%   13.243      1 Template:Cond\n 21.06%   13.218     23 Template:Trim\n 19.56%   12.275      3 Template:Icon_link\n 18.01%   11.305      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 17.26%   10.830      2 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 16.04%   10.065      2 Template:Item_icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:27964-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202742 and revision id 378368. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}